  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 4.92,
      "e": 7.72,
      "text": "^- [Christina] Airmen from the 48th Rescue Squadron,"
    },
    {
      "s": 7.72,
      "e": 9.87,
      "text": "^at Davis-Monthan Air Force Base,"
    },
    {
      "s": 9.87,
      "e": 13.25,
      "text": "responded to recovery operations for Hurricane Harvey,"
    },
    {
      "s": 13.25,
      "e": 15.25,
      "text": "on Tuesday, August 29th."
    },
    {
      "s": 16.43,
      "e": 19.18,
      "text": "^- We're providing boat operations"
    },
    {
      "s": 19.29,
      "e": 22.09,
      "text": "^to recover personnel that are stranded"
    },
    {
      "s": 22.09,
      "e": 26.26,
      "text": "due to the rising water and to the coastal cities."
    },
    {
      "s": 27.48,
      "e": 29.21,
      "text": "- [Christina] The mission is to identify"
    },
    {
      "s": 29.21,
      "e": 32.29,
      "text": "and extract stranded Texas residents,"
    },
    {
      "s": 32.44,
      "e": 34.34,
      "text": "in order to provide treatment"
    },
    {
      "s": 34.34,
      "e": 37.84,
      "text": "and escort them to medical response teams."
    },
    {
      "s": 38.01,
      "e": 40.54,
      "text": "- With our expertise and the number of men that we have,"
    },
    {
      "s": 40.54,
      "e": 43.96,
      "text": "and women, ready to respond, we're always"
    },
    {
      "s": 43.99,
      "e": 46.07,
      "text": "gonna be at the forefront."
    },
    {
      "s": 46.07,
      "e": 47.83,
      "text": "So when this opportunity comes"
    },
    {
      "s": 47.83,
      "e": 52.0,
      "text": "we're gonna chomp at the bit and put ourselves in."
    },
    {
      "s": 52.0,
      "e": 53.85,
      "text": "- [Christina] Airman First Class Christina Rios,"
    },
    {
      "s": 53.85,
      "e": 56.68,
      "text": "Davis-Monthan Air Force Base, Arizona."
    }
  ],
